1 NAME 'Abed Ela /ben Shalma/
1 SEX M
1 TITL President of the House of 'Abtah
1 OCCU priest, poet, translator
1 NOTE Generation 118. Forefather of the current Israelite Samaritan priestly
2 CONT families. Born and active in Damascus, then moved to Nablus to serve the
2 CONT high priests. Great poet, translator and teacher of religion. 'Abtah
2 CONT means Translator (Arabic: Haftawi) - the Itamar priests rendered the
2 CONT Phinhas High Priest's Hebrew reading of the Pentateuch into Aramaic, and
2 CONT are named for that duty. Source: A.B. - The Samaritan News / The
2 CONT Samaritan Update, March-April 2012, 'The High Priesthood and the
2 CONT Israelite Samaritan Priests', by Benyamim Tsedaka
